Z||000006||mrfixit58||10-23-2000||03:18 PM||||I've got one of those GTA sitting in my back yard. It's a parts car with heavy front end damage. It has the T.P.I. 350 w/ 700r4. I was thinking of saving it for my 65 SS Nova but, like I've said before... It sure would be sweet sitting behind me in my GT.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Now, if I can make room for that Paxon SC kit... :eek!:<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
